Ok, first off, if y’all didn’t know, Saruky is one of the main music production managers of the Funkin’ Crew (alongside also managing their Tiktok account)
Yesterday (August 12th), he decided to release never-before seen Work-In-Progresses of some of the songs of FNF
These include Girlfriends Jingle, Shootin Ropes, Stress(Pico Mix), and Lit Up(Bf Mix)
Lemme just say, out of all the WIPs he released that day, the Stress remix v3 was definitely the best one
(oh yeah, did I mention he released multiple versions of the same song, some are short though because the musical staccatos were changed)
It resonates with me on another level (considering my love of EDM, but the rock layer too, also all the music changes too)
The Lit Up BF Remix is a close second though, considering you can hear the background vocals for the original song a bit better 
It’s also just a vibe in general, honestly, I heavily encourage you to hear what I’m talking about on Saruky’s and Funkin New’s X account respectively 
(both of these links can be found in the “Important Links” section respectively or just search them up on Twitter yourself)

